From 5eed3f5c0cf8f45a3a04ea391d2901dada191400 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: terminills <tdeters@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 14:03:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 268/638] ozone: install Chromium cursors on AROS [chromium]
 [aros]

AI_PHASE: chromium-phase-4-ozone
AI_ROOT_CAUSE: ArosWindow::SetCursor was a no-op, while the generic bitmap cursor factory returned type-only server-side cursors that AROS could not resolve.
AI_FIX_REASON: Request Aura bitmap cursor assets and convert them to per-window AROS pointerclass objects, preserving hotspots and cleaning native resources on replacement and shutdown.
AI_SCOPE: AROS Ozone cursor factory and ArosWindow cursor lifecycle; animated cursors currently use their first frame.
AI_VALIDATION: buildtools clang-format and git diff --check pass; focused Ninja build rebuilt aros_window.o and ozone_platform_aros.o successfully.
AI_RISK: Medium; pointer bitmap color and alpha behavior requires hosted and native runtime validation.
AI_CHAIN:
---
 ui/ozone/platform/aros/aros_window.cc         | 74 ++++++++++++++++++-
 ui/ozone/platform/aros/aros_window.h          |  5 ++
 ui/ozone/platform/aros/ozone_platform_aros.cc | 21 +++++-
 3 files changed, 98 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

